OL,3,GNEWSANew warehouse pioneers system only
OL,4,Aused in China
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new giant warehouse in England's
OL,7,Flogistics "golden triangle" is adopting
OL,8,Fpioneering technology previously only
OL,9,Fused in China, a company said.
OL,11,FYusen Logistics UK said it will use a
OL,12,Frobotics and four-way conveyor system
OL,13,Fat its new site on the edge of
OL,14,FNorthampton, which will also employ
OL,15,Fhundreds of staff.
OL,17,F"There are some roles that robots can
OL,18,Fdo better than people, but
OL,19,Ffundamentally robots don't work without
OL,20,Fpeople," said David Evans, the
OL,21,Fcompany's managing director.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
