OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Japanese firm opened its 1.1m sq ft
OL,7,F(102,193 sq m) site with a fusion
OL,8,Fceremony that included a traditional
OL,9,Fcounting song, sushi, and fish and
OL,10,Fchips.
